    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10596" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίτεχν-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rival in an art</i> or
				<i>craft,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				816
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				493a
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἐκείνῳ οὐδὲ τοῖς ποιήμασιν
					αὐτοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					60d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				817b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ὁμότεχνος τοῖς ποιηταῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					12.46
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς μαγγανείας αὐτοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			.</div>
